{"schema_version":1,"id":"8rlcsybg2hhm","type":"collection","subtype":"work_collection","title":"十三經","description":{"text":"十三經是儒家十三部經書的合稱，南宋形成定本：《周易》《尚書》《毛詩》《周禮》《儀禮》《禮記》《春秋左氏傳》《春秋公羊傳》《春秋穀梁傳》《論語》《孝經》《爾雅》《孟子》。漢代立五經博士（易、書、詩、禮、春秋），唐代擴為九經，至南宋確立十三經之名。","sources":[]},"authors":[],"resources":[],"contained_works":[{"title":"爾雅","id":"d59f24mpohs2"},{"title":"孝經","id":"d59f1iosq6tc"},{"title":"孟子","id":"d59ezajwvda8"},{"title":"論語","id":"d59f1iopaku8"},{"title":"尚書","id":"d59ezajmkjcw"},{"title":"詩經","id":"d59ezak9zc3k"},{"title":"周易","id":"d59ezakdey2o"},{"title":"左傳","id":"d59ezak6jq4g"},{"title":"周禮","id":"d59f1ioc6m0w"},{"title":"儀禮","id":"d59ezak3445c"},{"title":"禮記","id":"d59f1iofm800"},{"title":"春秋","id":"d59ezajq05c0"},{"title":"公羊傳","id":"d59f1ioj1tz4"},{"title":"穀梁傳","id":"d59ezajtfrb4"}],"updated_at":"2026-07-31T04:34:52+00:00","_path":"Collection/h/h/m/8rlcsybg2hhm-十三經.json","_isDraft":false}